  "text": "Sabrent 500GB Rocket NVMe PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280 SB-ROCKET-NVME4-500 Please update your browser to take advantage of the latest technology security enhancements to ensure your B&H Shopping experience is as safe as it is enjoyable: Google Chrome Download Safari Download Firefox Download Microsoft Edge Download Feedback Home Sabrent 500GB Rocket NVMe PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280 Internal SSD BH # SASBRKTNVM45 • MFR # SB-ROCKET-NVME4-500 4 reviews Share Print Authorized Dealer Compare Key Features 500GB Capacity M.2 2280 PCIe 4.0 x4 Form Factor TLC NAND Flash Memory Up to 5000 MB/s Read Speed Show More Speed up storage and boost performance with the 500GB Rocket NVMe PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280 Internal SSD from Sabrent . This solid-state drive supports an NVMe PCIe M.2 interface with a form factor of 2280 (80mm). Featuring Toshiba's BiCS4 96L TLC NAND Flash memory and PCIe 4.0 bandwidth, the drive has a maximum read speed of 5000 MB/s and a 2500 MB/s write speed when installed onto a compatible motherboard. It's backward compatible with PCI 3.0 motherboards, which will deliver read speeds of up to 3400 MB/s and 2500 MB/s write speeds. More Details No Longer Available No Store Display Chat Request Callback Email 800-606-6969 Overview Specs Reviews 4 Q&A Sabrent Rocket Internal SSD Overview Speed up storage and boost performance with the 500GB Rocket NVMe PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280 Internal SSD from Sabrent . This solid-state drive supports an NVMe PCIe M.2 interface with a form factor of 2280 (80mm). Featuring Toshiba's BiCS4 96L TLC NAND Flash memory and PCIe 4.0 bandwidth, the drive has a maximum read speed of 5000 MB/s and a 2500 MB/s write speed when installed onto a compatible motherboard. It's backward compatible with PCI 3.0 motherboards, which will deliver read speeds of up to 3400 MB/s and 2500 MB/s write speeds. This storage drive is also designed to work with Open NAND Flash Interfaces, including ONFi 2.3, ONFi 3.0, ONFi 3.2, and ONFi 4.0. Its built-in power management allows the SSD to work with Autonomous Power State Transition, Active State Power Management, and L1.2 low-power standby modes. Other features include support for SMART and TRIM commands, in addition to integrated Advanced Wear Leveling, Bad Block Management, and Over-Provision technology. 500GB M.2 2280 PCIe 4.0 x4 solid-state drive PCIe 4.0 support with up to 5000 MB/s read and 2500 MB/s write speeds Backward compatible with PCIe 3.0 with up to 3400 MB/s read and 2500 MB/s write speeds Built-in power support for with Autonomous Power State Transition, Active State Power Management, and L1.2 low-power standby modes Support for SMART and TRIM commands ONFi 2.3, ONFi 3.0, ONFi 3.2 and ONFi 4.0 interface support Integrated Advanced Wear Leveling, Bad Block Management, Error Correction Code, and Over-Provision Sabrent 500GB Rocket NVMe PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280 Internal SSD Limited 1-Year Manufacturer Warranty Limited 5-Year Manufacturer Warranty (if Registered Within 90-Days) No additional resources available Sabrent Rocket Internal SSD Specs Mean Time Between Failures (MTBF) 1.7 Million Hours Electrical Power Draw 6.2 W Operating Shock 1500 G General Weight 2.4 oz / 68 g Packaging Info Package Weight 0.2 lb Box Dimensions (LxWxH) 4.4 x 3.4 x 1.7\" Sabrent Rocket Internal SSD Reviews See any errors on this page? Let us know Whatever You Need, We've Got It",
